    "detailed_description": "Four Model Museum, which focuses on the narration of the subjects named 4 Models within the scope of the experimental public relations education developed with the collaboration of Istanbul Ayd\u0131n University New Media Application and Research Center to be used in public relations education, with virtual reality technology; With its virtual reality headset and controllers, it allows you to take the user on a historical journey and provide a cultural museum visit.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWith the Four Model Museum;<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe narration of the subjects named four models within the body of public relations, by historical characters in a museum; It is also supported visually and aurally. In addition to this, the animations of historical moments and events that have taken place in the subjects named four models allow the user to experience them through virtual reality and provide impressive educational results.",
    "about_the_game": "Four Model Museum, which focuses on the narration of the subjects named 4 Models within the scope of the experimental public relations education developed with the collaboration of Istanbul Ayd\u0131n University New Media Application and Research Center to be used in public relations education, with virtual reality technology; With its virtual reality headset and controllers, it allows you to take the user on a historical journey and provide a cultural museum visit.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWith the Four Model Museum;<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe narration of the subjects named four models within the body of public relations, by historical characters in a museum; It is also supported visually and aurally. In addition to this, the animations of historical moments and events that have taken place in the subjects named four models allow the user to experience them through virtual reality and provide impressive educational results.",
    "short_description": "Four model contents in public relations, which is one of the topics in public relations education, have been developed to support the educational process using virtual reality technology.",
